<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PGM year profit edges up, dividend flat.</title>
<headline>PGM year profit edges up, dividend flat.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     13.2	  vs 11.9</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 6.0	   vs same</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.97	  vs 1.77</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.81	  vs 2.16</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.59	  vs 0.35</p>
<p>    Interest received     2.41	  vs 2.01</p>
<p>Div payable January 6, 1997</p>
<p>on register November 29</p>
<p>Full name: PGM Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Mining investor PGM Investments Ltd said that no improvement is 1997 earnings is expected due to the continued surplus of platinum group metal stocks and uncertainty about interest rate levels.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
